        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_mandrake_draught",
        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungimandrakedraught_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A bitter brown draught steeped from mandrake root. A sleeping draught: for most of a day it calms you and makes you drowsy, so sleep comes easier."
    },
