        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungimandrakedraught_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Preparation:</b> Steep a mandrake root in a bowl of hot water.\n\n<b>Benefits:</b> Gives the same soporific effect as vanilla Fairy Tea: stress and wakefulness fall while it lasts, and it wears off over the following day. A medicine: allied Partners leave it alone."
    },
